+
+| Known | Exact gap | Discriminating next step |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Rational macroscopic atoms vanish when a=1/2 | A mesoscopic front need not be a fixed Haar model | Check partial-period Fejér transfer and local-balance quantifiers |
