+| Half-set cyclic exponent 1/3 is quoted from Sanders v2 | A stronger cyclic or coupled lemma | Verify the source and derive a precise sufficient continuation statement |
+
+UNKNOWN at this checkpoint: whether a square-root periodic roughness bound holds without regularity of the removal schedule. Failed steps and their counterexamples will be preserved below as they are found.
