+
+PROVED nested specialization. If b_c(t)=1[0<=t<u_c], u_c in [0,1], let nu=(1/N)*sum_{u_c>0} delta_(u_c), so p(t)=nu((t,1]) for t>=0 and p0=nu((0,1]). Then, for xi!=0,
