+NUMERICAL supporting VM probe, seed 2026101913: X=65536, 262144, 1048576, with L=256,512,1024 and N=2, gave sampled M/X=0.0729651, 0.0360164, 0.0342205. These are uncertified global estimates; the theorem above supplies the asymptotic all-circle upper bound. Independent 220-bit Arb evaluations certify the saved negative points, not an upper bound on their actual M. Exact run endpoints and grid indices are saved in `nonnested_X*.json`.
