+PROVED artifact verification record: Python 3.12.3, NumPy version stored in `roughness_results.json`, Gurobi 13.0.3 for both MILPs, Arb precision 220 bits. `independent_checks.json` records 980 exact count checks, six independently enclosed continuum/finite-set dips, four scalar arithmetic checks and three nonnested probe records. `manifest.json` contains source/data SHA256 values. These are paper proofs plus finite exact/Arb checks, not Lean kernel proofs. All mathematical jobs used the required VM wrapper with four cores. No commits, subagents, root research-record edits or LaTeX artifacts were made by this round.
